    {
      "id": 27656,
      "category": "researcher",
      "content": "Spring boot actuator files/endpoints can be accessed via path like `stripo.email/██████/actuator/*`, including a 110 MB `heapdump` file, which expose source code, private keys and some internal data!\n\nThe maximum severity of this asset is medium, so neither I nor the triage team have been able to set severity as critical.",
